      "text": "A thumbnail of a HealthEnabled African Digital Dashboard, a one-page infographic-style country profile with a map of Africa, coloured text boxes and small charts summarizing national eHealth policy and deployment information; individual text within the thumbnail is too small to read and could not be determined from the extracted image.",
